(card "exp:H-R3b-1_c84_kelly_lambda_0.25" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R3b-1_c84_kelly_lambda_0.25"
  :body "---\nnav: 5\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R3b-1\nshort_name: c84_kelly_lambda_0.25\ntitle: \"H-R3b-1 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=0.25\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r3b\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.4807\ntrain_trade_count: 179\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8771\ntrain_sharpe: 7.8840\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0054\nval_nav_mean: 1.0974\nval_nav_sigma: 0.1042\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4406\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.7613\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0034\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r3b, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R3b-1 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=0.25\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R3b sweep 最保守档 λ=0.25。train NAV 3.48 / test 1.44，仍胜 anchor 显著（test +0.19）；**val sharpe 7.88 全 sweep 第一**，max_dd -0.34% 最小。是\"sizing 信号弱了一档但 sharpe-risk 优\"的代表。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- λ=0.25 = 把 ratio/median 偏离压低 75%，size 几乎是 fixed 1.0 ± 微调；接近 binary baseline 但加一点 directional bias。\n- 验证 \"λ 越小，越接近 H-R3b-0 binary baseline 性能\" 的极限趋势。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_3b_runner.py`\n- 公式：\n\n  $$\n  \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(0.25 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}} - 1\\right) + 1,\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right)\n  $$\n\n- mean_size = 1.102, std_size = 0.167（最紧）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median`，strict past-only，warmup=10。\n- critic audit pass，`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.4807 | 179 | 7.88 | 87.7% | -0.54% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0974 ± 0.104 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4406 | 31 | 7.76 | 80.6% | -0.34% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.192 | +11 | +0.61 | +5.6pp | +0.19pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。\n- 实际 risk-adjusted 表现 = **整个 R3b 最佳 sharpe + 最小 dd**。NAV 略低 (1.44 vs 1.49) 但 dd 显著更小。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]]\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]]（NAV 主标尺）\n- **dominates_in_sharpe**: 全 H-R3b（R3b-1 sharpe 最高）\n- **builds on**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]]\n- **near_neighbor**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-0__c84_binary_baseline]] (λ=0 fixed size)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R3b-1)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- R3b-1 + R3b-0-binary 一起证明 **\"即使 size 不放大，C8.4 这套 trade pool 本身就赢\"**。所以 sizing 真正 add 的 NAV 是 R3b-4 (3.70) − R3b-0 (3.15) ≈ 0.55；剩余 NAV gain 全部来自 trade-selector C8.4。\n- production rollout 候选短名单：R3b-4 (NAV-max) / R3b-2 (sharpe-NAV balance) / R3b-1 (sharpe-max conservative)。\n"
